# ============================================================
# DL/CMX research repo — GitHub push rules
# Excluded on purpose: model checkpoints, virtualenvs, raw
# dataset images, bulk prediction/training-log image dumps.
# ============================================================

# ---- Model checkpoints / weights (NOT pushed) ----
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.safetensors

# ---- Python environments & caches ----
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/

# ---- Raw dataset images (kept local, not source code) ----
datasets/

# ---- Bulk per-sample prediction masks (regenerable dumps) ----
predictions_*/

# ---- Bulk image dumps: everything png is excluded first... ----
*.png

# ---- ...then only the curated result figures are re-included ----
!**/results/**/*.png
!**/comparison_results/**/*.png
!**/CMX_E0_E5_ALL_GRAPHS/**/*.png
!research_assets/CMX_PRESENTATION_RESULTS/**/*.png
!research_assets/CMX_Research_Plots/**/*.png
!research_assets/CMX_Research_Matrices/**/*.png
!research_assets/CMX_ALL_MODEL_COMPARISON/**/*.png
